        "title": "Definition",
        "text": "$$\\tan\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{4}\\right)$$ is the slope of the line connecting the origin to the point on the unit circle at $$\\left(\\cos\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{4}\\right), \\sin\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{4}\\right)\\right).$$\\n##figure7.gif##",
